","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosenfeld/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosenfeld/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosenfeld/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosenfeld/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2013-04-03T12:29:13Z","updated_at":"2013-04-03T12:29:13Z","body":"It affects my application and there is a work-around to make it work under production currently... I use the js-routes gem and it will generate the url's incorrectly most probably due to this bug. Then I'll call \"head :ok\" from some actions but since the URL is incorrectly generated and ends up with a \".json\" it will render \"content-type: application/json\" and since \"head :ok\" will render a single space instead of an empty string jQuery will try to call JSON.parse(' '), which results in an error and then my application stops working because a successful action will result in an error in the client-side. For now I've overrided the \"head\" method in ApplicationController so that it renders json: {} if the argument is :ok.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rails/rails/issues/comments/15833718/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"rosenfeld","id":32246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjQ2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosenfeld","html_url":"https://github.com/rosenfeld","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosenfeld/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosenfeld/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosenfeld/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosenfeld/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosenfeld/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosenfeld/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosenfeld/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosenfeld/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosenfeld/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rails/rails/issues/comments/15834255","html_url":"https://github.com/rails/rails/issues/10071#issuecomment-15834255","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rails/rails/issues/10071","id":15834255,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDE1ODM0MjU1","user":{"login":"senny","id":5402,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MDI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5402?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/senny","html_url":"https://github.com/senny","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senny/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senny/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senny/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senny/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senny/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senny/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senny/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senny/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senny/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2013-04-03T12:42:56Z","updated_at":"2013-04-03T12:42:56Z","body":"thanks for the heads up, I think I can confirm this problem and am able to reproduce:\n\n``` ruby\n  def test_scope_with_format_option\n    draw do\n      get \"direct/index\", as: :no_format_direct, format: false\n\n      scope format: false do\n        get \"scoped/index\", as: :no_format_scoped\n      end\n    end\n\n    assert_equal \"/direct/index\", no_format_direct_path\n    assert_equal \"/direct/index?format=html\", no_format_direct_path(format: \"html\")\n\n    assert_equal \"/scoped/index\", no_format_scoped_path\n    assert_equal \"/scoped/index?format=html\", no_format_scoped_path(format: \"html\")\n\n    get '/scoped/index'\n    assert_equal \"scoped#index\", @response.body\n\n    get '/scoped/index.html'\n    assert_equal \"Not Found\", @response.body\n  end\n```\n\nfails with:\n\n```\nExpected: \"/scoped/index?format=html\"\n  Actual: \"/scoped/index.html\"\n```\n\nI'll look into it and see if I can come up with a solution.\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rails/rails/issues/comments/15834255/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"senny","id":5402,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MDI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5402?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/senny","html_url":"https://github.com/senny","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senny/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senny/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senny/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senny/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senny/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senny/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senny/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senny/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senny/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rails/rails/issues/comments/15834505","html_url":"https://github.com/rails/rails/issues/10071#issuecomment-15834505","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rails/rails/issues/10071","id":15834505,"